{"retryCount is updated via retryCount: reminder.retryCount + 1, which is susceptible to lost updates if multiple workers/processes pick up the same reminder concurrently - should use Prisma's atomic increment operation": 0.748721718788147, "The deleteMany filter deletes reminders with retryCount > 1 without scoping to SMS reminders, which could unintentionally delete non-SMS workflow reminders that have retryCount incremented": 0.9171990752220154, "retryCount is incremented both when scheduledSMS is falsy and when an exception is thrown - need to verify this matches intended semantics and that reminders won't be retried indefinitely between increments and the delete job timing": 0.3506825566291809}